# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Aapda Setu — Backend environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# DO NOT commit a populated .env file to version control.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Twilio SMS (optional — falls back to simulated alerts when not set) ──────
#
# HOW TO GET THESE VALUES:
#   1. Sign up for a free Twilio trial at https://www.twilio.com/try-twilio
#   2. On the Twilio Console homepage you will see:
#        Account SID   (starts with "AC...")
#        Auth Token    (click the eye icon to reveal)
#   3. Go to Phone Numbers → Manage → Buy a number (free with trial credit)
#      This is your TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER.
#   4. Go to Phone Numbers → Verified Caller IDs → Add a new number
#      Add YOUR OWN mobile number here (Twilio trial only sends to verified numbers).
#      Copy that number into VERIFIED_DEMO_PHONE_NUMBERS.
#
# TWILIO TRIAL SAFETY:
#   A Twilio trial account can ONLY text numbers you have manually verified
#   in the Twilio console. This code adds a second safety layer on top: it
#   reads the allowlist from VERIFIED_DEMO_PHONE_NUMBERS and never dials any
#   number that isn't on it.
#
# Format: E.164 format — +91XXXXXXXXXX for Indian numbers, +1XXXXXXXXXX for US.
# Multiple numbers: comma-separated, e.g. +91XXXXXXXXXX,+91YYYYYYYYYY
#
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=ACxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_auth_token_here
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1XXXXXXXXXX
VERIFIED_DEMO_PHONE_NUMBERS=+91XXXXXXXXXX

# ── Optional: override the log level (DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR) ───────────
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# ── Optional: restrict CORS to specific origins ──────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list. Defaults to localhost:5173 and localhost:3000 if unset.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-frontend.vercel.app
